# The toolchain CI builds and tests the Solana vault program with, in one
# place: solana-toolchain.sh installs exactly this, solana-rebuild.sh builds
# with it, the build record names it, and the CI cache key hashes this file.
# Sourced by bash, so plain KEY=value lines only.
#
# Each download is pinned by size and SHA-256 and checked before it is
# unpacked. A mismatch fails the job. Where the pins came from (2026-10-19):
#
# - agave: GitHub's upload digest for the v2.3.13 release asset (asset id
#   302814746, uploaded by anza-team on 2025-10-10). Independent pins of the
#   same value exist in vaporif/anchor-overlay and BluefootLabs' SBF workflow.
# - platform-tools: GitHub records no digest for this asset (id 254652416,
#   uploaded by the release workflow on 2025-05-14 and never replaced). The
#   value is the fetchurl pin held by three unrelated Nix projects:
#   cosmos/ibc-contracts, timewave-computer/zero.nix and vaporif/anchor-overlay.
#   Nobody here downloaded the file to compute it. If it is wrong, the job
#   fails closed rather than building with an unchecked compiler.
#   Confirmed on 2026-10-20 by the first solana · test and solana · rebuild
#   runs (PR #353, Actions run 39499922824): fetch-verified.sh downloaded the
#   asset from GitHub and it matched this size and SHA-256.
# - criterion: cargo-build-sbf always installs Snaipe's Criterion C test
#   library beside platform-tools (~/.cache/solana/<version>/criterion) and
#   downloads it, checked against nothing, when it is missing. The first CI
#   runs showed it fetching v2.3.3, so solana-toolchain.sh now installs that
#   archive itself from this pin. GitHub records no digest for the asset
#   (Snaipe/Criterion release v2.3.3); the size and SHA-256 were computed from
#   the file downloaded from the release on 2026-10-20.
#
# PLATFORM_TOOLS_RUSTC and the version line cargo-build-sbf prints are checked
# against each other, so a pin cannot be changed without the other.
# HOST_RUST runs test.sh's cargo test steps (host Rust, not platform-tools).
# It is the only host Rust on the machine where the audit's test.sh run passed
# on 2026-10-18 (8 native, 9 runtime tests); newer is untested.

AGAVE_VERSION=v2.3.13
AGAVE_ASSET=solana-release-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.bz2
AGAVE_BYTES=271622670
AGAVE_SHA256=c43539ebdf6942472e8b87635d6ea55f428a51e3d0219f7b6f720fc6b19fade0

PLATFORM_TOOLS_VERSION=v1.48
PLATFORM_TOOLS_ASSET=platform-tools-linux-x86_64.tar.bz2
PLATFORM_TOOLS_BYTES=516334851
PLATFORM_TOOLS_SHA256=a9d3157f937d5f6faf4321a35a8035e0f827114a663b0150db492e893ec27597
PLATFORM_TOOLS_RUSTC=1.84.1
CRITERION_VERSION=v2.3.3
CRITERION_ASSET=criterion-v2.3.3-linux-x86_64.tar.bz2
CRITERION_BYTES=677858
CRITERION_SHA256=ee7f92d7268563848aa3ae90bbf5df86604b8d0fb0e4942b0ecfbf6201596550

SBF_ARCH=v0

HOST_RUST=1.98.1
